! The field around D0 and D1 ~ a spirit's handoff, held unedited

''Register: Testimony-Verbatim.'' Nothing below makes this house's own claim. It holds what a tasked spirit reported from a web-research pass, handed a framing and no conclusion, kept whole, as a ''collision surface''. The spirit read primary sources where the proxy let it (the TW5 core, the Performance plugin branch, idiomorph, worker-dom, remote-dom, ProseMirror, MDN) and marks the rest as search snippets.

''What the house took from it.'' D0 reads `$tw.perf.measures` and wraps its own camera, since `render.js` never runs in the island; D0 re-invokes `$:/tags/StartupAction` itself once the seed drains. D1 collides its serializer promotion with the select widget's `value` write, its sensed-revision veto with idiomorph's focused-element-only guards, and its one-task IME hold with the field's timestamp window (`dreamdom#/open-rulings`).

''Read it against us, not for us.'' Collide it; do not inherit it.

